  "text": "Find 24 Hour Vet Near Me: American Vet Center in Cairo & Alexandria | Expert Pet Care\ntop of page\nVIEW ALL LOCATIONS\nLocation\nOPEN DAILY - WALK-INS WELCOME - APPOINTMENTS VIA WHATSAPP OR PHONE\nHome\nServices\nAbout us\nContact\nLocations\nZamalek\nMaadi\nSheikh Zayed\nSheraton\nRehab (New Cairo)\nFAQ's\nMembers\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nMail\na.v.c.1@hotmail.com\n@americanvetcenter\nOUR BRANCHES\nAt American Vet Center, we make expert veterinary care easy and accessible with six clinics across Egypt: Zamalek, Sheikh Zayed, Sheraton (Heliopolis), Ma’adi, New Cairo (Rehab), and Alexandria. Each location is staffed by our experienced veterinarians and equipped with modern facilities to provide everything your pet needs — from routine check-ups and vaccinations to dental care, diagnostics, surgery, and emergency services. Wherever you are, compassionate, high-quality care for your pets is always nearby.\nFind and Click your nearest clinic below and book your visit today — we’re here 7 days a week.\n▪️Zamalek: 30 El Gezira El Wosta\n01110801801 - (02)27376664/8\n▪️Zayed: District 13, 1st Neighbourhood, St 12\n01110802802 - 01210813869 - (02) 38956948\n▪️Maadi: 11C, 199 St., Degla\n01110803803 - 01210814356 - (02) 25177266\n▪️Sheraton: 2 El Shaheed Mahmoud Esmat Hamdy\n01060300853 - 01210813549 - (02) 22666996\n▪️New Cairo: B60 Eastern Market, El Rehab 2\n01118848190 - 01210813687\n▪️New York: 30-81 Steinway St, Queens, NY 11103, USA\n+1 (917) 396-4296 - +1 (718) 685-2484\nChat with us on Whatsapp\nCall\n+201210826108\nPhone\nTerms and Conditions\nEmail\na.v.c.1@hotmail.com\nMail\nPrivacy Policy\nFollow\namericanvetcenter\nFAQ's\nbottom of page",
